## Features
- 240 warm white LEDs with 8 lighting modes;
- 3-piece reindeer and sleigh set for festive charm;
- Sturdy powder-coated metal frame;
- 6H on/18H off daily timer for easy lighting;
- Weather-resistant rattan with no glitter shedding;

## Information
Transform your garden, porch, or indoor space into a festive wonderland with this 3-piece light-up reindeer and sleigh set. Crafted with brown PP rattan and a strong metal frame, these holiday decorations feature warm white LEDs with 8 lighting modes, from steady glow to flashing, plus a daily timer. Enjoy a mess-free rattan display with no glitter cleanup.
